## Section 3 — Implementation Order & Verification

### Implementation order (by dependency, not severity)

1. **Fix 1** (conditions.ts loop control) — standalone, no dependencies
2. **Fix 3** (deepseek.ts structuredChat signal/timeout) — update the `structuredChat` signature, then update the caller in `conditions.ts`
3. **Fix 2** (health-check.ts embedding probe) — standalone, but check `src/engine/ollama.ts` for the same gap
4. **Fix 4** (triologue.ts lastUserQuery) — standalone
5. **Fix 5** (agent-repl.ts backlog catch) — standalone
6. **Fix 6** (compile-utils.ts create_lock atomic) — check call site for EEXIST handling
7. **Fix 7** (session/index.ts writeSession atomic) — standalone
8. **Fix 8** (token.ts CJK truncation) — standalone
9. **Fix 9** (verbose-log.ts writeChunk observability) — ensure `origStderrWrite` is declared before `writeChunk`
10. **Fix 10** (serve-history.ts timestamp sort) — standalone
11. **Fix 11** (git_commit.ts stdin) — remove temp-file logic, clean up unused imports

