|------|--------|-------|
| `src/loop/agent-repl.ts` | Insert auto-compile block after line 319, before line 324 | Phase 1 |
| `src/context/shared/loader.ts` | In `reloadSkill`, add fire-and-forget compile for skills with `when` | Phase 2 |

### Phase 1 implementation (agent-repl.ts)

After line 319 (`loader.setConditionRegistry(conditions);`), before line 324:

