  | { type: 'reload'; serveActive: boolean; servePort: number; serveHost: string | null }
  | { type: 'exit' }
  | { type: 'serve_mode'; active: boolean }
  | { type: 'serve_shutdown_done' }
  | { type: 'skill_reindex' };  // ← NEW
```

In `child.on('message')` (line 177), add a relay branch:

