## Data Flow

```
1. Lead calls tm_create(name, role, prompt, sim_tools=[{name:"weather", ...}])
2. TeamManager.createTeammate() spawns child, sends spawn message with simTools
3. teammate-worker.ts handleSpawn():
   - silentLoader.loadAll() loads built-in + project + user tools
   - For each simTool: registerTool() with IPC-routing stub handler
   - teammateLoop() starts; silentLoader.getToolsForScope('child') now includes sim-tools
4. Teammate LLM calls weather({city: "Tokyo"})
5. silentLoader.execute("weather", ctx, args) → stub handler
6. Stub handler: ipc.sendRequest('sim_tool_call', {toolName, toolDescription, args})
7. Parent TeamManager.handleChildMessage → IpcRegistry.dispatch → sim_tool_call handler
8. simulateToolCall(): mini-loop with real tools → LLM calls web_fetch(weather API) → returns text
9. sendResponse('sim_tool_result', true, {result})
10. Child IpcClient resolves promise → stub handler returns result string
11. teammate-worker triologue.tool("weather", result) — teammate sees it as a normal tool result
```

